sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Member
    participant ChatRoom as ChatRoom<br/>(Concrete Subject)
    participant Bot as Bot<br/>(Concrete Observer / Context)
    participant State as currentState<br/>(Concrete State)
    participant Community as WaterballCommunity

    Note over ChatRoom,Bot: Push：事件必要資料直接隨 CommunityEvent 傳遞
    Member->>ChatRoom: sendMessage(...)
    ChatRoom->>ChatRoom: postMessage(message)
    ChatRoom->>Bot: update(MessageReceivedEvent(message))
    Bot->>Bot: onMessageReceived(message)
    Bot->>State: onMessageReceived(bot, message)

    alt State 處理只需要訊息本身
        State->>Bot: replyChatMessage(content, tags)
        Bot->>ChatRoom: postMessage(botMessage)
    else State 需要額外的即時領域狀態
        Note over State,Community: Pull：只在需要時查詢既有 OOA FN
        State->>Community: getOnlineCount()
        Community-->>State: onlineCount
        opt 需要標記所有在線參與者
            State->>Community: getOnlineParticipants()
            Community-->>State: participants
        end
        State->>Bot: commentPost(...) / replyChatMessage(...)
    end

    Note over ChatRoom,Community: Observer 仍只有 update(event) 一套通知機制；<br/>Pull 只是 State 處理事件時的正常領域查詢，不是第二套 Observer。
